  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Phase 1 - Found in Herbal Notes\n\nShe said she'd made up her mind, that
    what I was doing was right. The joy of new life cannot erase the poverty that
    comes with it\u2014it's just that she didn't yet have the courage to watch a
    little life pass away...\n\nShe placed the yellow iris in my hand, saying she'd
    be my lookout from now on. I wanted to thank her, but I didn't know what to say.\n\nThis
    marks the beginning of E and M's secret collaboration. E, a midwife, acknowledges
    the necessity of M's work helping women in need."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
